## 15. The tutorial

Jitters (the Cafe's own); one guided order through every station: "Latte: large cup, latte, bold, whole milk, with
extra shot. Sprinkle Donut: classic dough, golden, strawberry glaze, with sprinkles." The whole milk comes down spoiled
(`gross: { item: 0, slot: 'milk', event: 'spoiled' }`), so Swap It is taught once, on a pick. Always Simple (the pour
runs by itself); Mitch warns before each mistake. 14 presses done right, plus the Swap It: 15.

## 16. Press counts (`pressReport('cafe')`, Serve included; the same at every level)

| recipe | levels | Simple | Timed |
|---|---|---|---|
| coffee | 1-5 | 10 (size, drink, cream, shot, vanilla, caramel, sugar ×2, whipped cream, Serve) | 11 (+ the pour) |
| blackCoffee | 1-5 | 9 (the sugar is one Skip) | 10 |
| redEye | 2-5 | 9 | 10 |
| latte, cappuccino, vanillaLatte, wakeUpCall | 1-5 / 2-5 / 3-5 | 8 (size, drink, milk, shot, vanilla, caramel, whipped cream, Serve) | 9 |
| hotChocolate | 2-5 | 7 (no pour, no extra shot) | 7 |
| every donut | 1-5 | 7 (dough, fryer, glaze, sprinkles, coconut, nuts, Serve) | 7 (the fryer is one stop either way) |
| giantDonut (event) | event | 7 alone; the finale with the Red Eye 15 | 16 |

Whole orders (bots, 25 shifts a level, both modes): level 1 and 2 at most 11; levels 3-5 and the event at most 21
(Gus's two Coffees, Timed); a drink and a donut 13-17; every odd order 7-10; the tutorial 15. Budget (spec 4.3): level
1 ≤ 14, any order ≤ 28.

